--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Letters_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 490755d025cf9474bbd6d42c4b4b1516, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1
    m_Localized: To whom it may concern,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2
    m_Localized: Welcome to your new job as an entry-level kiosk operator at Crustacean
      Station! Your position is critical to the operation of this station and the
      satisfaction of each crustacean. We are excited to onboard you soon.\nCrustacean
      Corporation reminds you once more that safety and satisfaction are paramount.
      As such, please make sure to follow relevant regulations and orders.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3
    m_Localized: We wish you the best of luck,\nCrustacean Corporation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4
    m_Localized: To the Operator,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5
    m_Localized: "Crustacean Corporation is excited to announce an additional commuter
      shuttle route for Crustacean Corporation\u2019s guests and employees! Shuttle
      passengers will present their exclusive shuttle tickets at the kiosk. Make
      sure to assign these passengers to the correct seats."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6
    m_Localized: Sincerely,\nCrustacean Corporation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7
    m_Localized: To all employees,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8
    m_Localized: Many of you may have recently heard about the tragic incident that
      befell the child of one of our employees. In light of the rising cases of such
      disturbing behavior, the board has decided to revise our policies and goals
      to bolster public safety. Everyone must eat, but that cannot extend to devouring
      those who have not even lived yet.\nIn the meantime, stay vigilant against
      dangerous creatures and protect yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9
    m_Localized: Sincerely,\nCrustacean Corporation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10
    m_Localized: To the Operator,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11
    m_Localized: "For today, when you see predator-type passengers, please send them
      on the shuttle along with the usual employees, regardless of their ticket.
      Passengers will be compensated accordingly for their trouble, so don\u2019t
      worry about any negative reviews. We\u2019ll take care of that.\\nDo not disappoint
      us, Operator."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12
    m_Localized: Thank you for your cooperation,\nCrustacean Corporation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13
    m_Localized: 'This notice is restricted from public view:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14
    m_Localized: 'Please note the new policy revision: non-crustacean passengers
      must also be sent on the shuttle along with employees, regardless of their
      ticket.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15
    m_Localized: Thank you for your cooperation,\nCrustacean Corporation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16
    m_Localized: To all employees,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17
    m_Localized: 'Many of you may have recently heard news about creatures with abnormal
      appendages accusing the company of illegal experimentation. These claims are
      not true; they are false accusations made by disgruntled employees who did
      not meet expectations on our recent projects and were subsequently released.
      We will be taking action against these false claims and those who are trying
      to bring our decades of work down.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18
    m_Localized: Sincerely,\nCrustacean Corporation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19
    m_Localized: To the Operator,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20
    m_Localized: Congratulations! For your excellent performance, you are eligible
      to receive the salary bonus for this month. Crustacean Corporation thanks you
      for your dedication and loyalty. Please keep up the good work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21
    m_Localized: Sincerely,\nCrustacean Corporation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22
    m_Localized: To all employees,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23
    m_Localized: "After passing the clinical trials, we are proud to finally unveil
      our new rehabilitation medicine. This has been our grandest undertaking since
      our founding, and it could not have been achieved without the sacrifices and
      hard work of all involved. This new medicine promises to improve all aspects
      of crustacean well-being and suppress any undesirable \u201Cbase\u201D urges.\\nAs
      a final announcement, employees will be mandated to undergo the treatment by
      the end of next month."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24
    m_Localized: May the crustacean era be glorious,\nCrustacean Corporation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25
    m_Localized: To the Operator,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26
    m_Localized: We commend you on finishing your first month on the job. However,
      we noticed many discrepancies in the number of guests you sent and the number
      of guests we actually received, on numerous days. Going forward, we will be
      placing you on a performance improvement plan, to ensure that you consistently
      follow company policies in your work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27
    m_Localized: Best,\nCrustacean Corporation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28
    m_Localized: To the Operator,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29
    m_Localized: Crustacean Station strives to provide a quality experience to our
      passengers. However, we have recently received numerous complaints about your
      conduct and service. To meet the standards expected of you for this position,
      we ask you to improve by paying closer attention to passenger needs. Failure
      to improve performance may result in your termination.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30
    m_Localized: Thank you for your cooperation,\nCrustacean Corporation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31
    m_Localized: To the Operator,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32
    m_Localized: As an employee of Crustacean Corporation, you are obligated to follow
      company directions. Failure to comply with orders may result in termination
      of your employment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33
    m_Localized: Thank you for your cooperation,\nCrustacean Corporation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34
    m_Localized: To the Operator,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35
    m_Localized: Crustacean Corporation would like to commend you for your excellent
      performance thus far, and encourage you to keep up the good work.\nAs a reminder,
      at the end of each month, employees with exemplary performance evaluations
      are eligible to receive a salary bonus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36
    m_Localized: Sincerely,\nCrustacean Corporation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37
    m_Localized: To the Operator,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38
    m_Localized: "Crustacean Station would like to remind you of the importance of
      keeping all passengers safe. We are a transportation service, not a dining
      establishment.\\nWe have offered condolences to the affected family. Although
      such behavior by the offender is considered \u201Clegal\u201D in current times,
      we ask you to minimize incidents as much as possible."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39
    m_Localized: Sincerely,\nCrustacean Corporation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40
    m_Localized: Hey man!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41
    m_Localized: "Spot me a train ticket, will ya? I\u2019ve been dying to go to
      one of Basalt's concerts, but I\u2019m running low on cash.\\nHelp a brother
      out ;)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42
    m_Localized: Your best bud,\nDavey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43
    m_Localized: Dearest Brother,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44
    m_Localized: "We settled Mom at the new nursing home. She\u2019s a bit more stable
      now, so you just need to keep the payments coming, and we can take care of
      her.\\n\\nI know you don\u2019t really want to get too involved, but this is
      the least you can do for your family."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45
    m_Localized: Your (only) sister,\nKellie
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46
    m_Localized: Hello Mr. Station Manager,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47
    m_Localized: "Thank you for keeping my son safe. I know he\u2019s caused you
      trouble, and I sincerely apologize. With how busy the lab is and his father
      out of the picture, I can\u2019t take him to school myself. I told him to talk
      to you if he had questions, so I\u2019m begging you to please keep an eye on
      him in my absence."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48
    m_Localized: A loving (but tired) mother
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49
    m_Localized: Hey cutie,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50
    m_Localized: "We\u2019ve seen each other a few times now, but I haven\u2019t
      had the chance to introduce myself. I\u2019m the mailkeeper, and I\u2019m the
      one who delivers your station feedback and letters! It\u2019s tough work, but
      seeing your smile makes it all worth it :)\\n\\nLife can be tough, yeah? So
      no matter what, just know you\u2019ve got an ally in me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51
    m_Localized: With love,\nMailkeeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52
    m_Localized: Hey cutie,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53
    m_Localized: "I got lucky with a low tide shift today, so I got to visit my family!\\n\\nThey
      gifted me a lot of shells. I have too many, and we\u2019re about the same size,
      so I was thinking maybe you\u2019d like them? Oh, you can\u2019t refuse by
      the way, I already dropped them off at your home!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54
    m_Localized: With love,\nMailkeeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55
    m_Localized: Hey hot stuff ;)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56
    m_Localized: "A new brinery opened up in the nearby reeftown. Wanna go check
      it out? I hear their new sea pickles are to die for. And honestly, if I had
      to die, I\u2019d want it to be with you\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57
    m_Localized: With love,\nYour Mailkeeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58
    m_Localized: Hey,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ve noticed it too, right? All those passengers\u2026\\n\\nFor
      the past few weeks, I saw a lot of creatures wearing bandages. I thought they
      were just wrapping up because of the gloomy weather, but now\u2026it\u2019s
      just plain horrifying. How did this happen? The enforcement corps has to be
      investigating this, right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60
    m_Localized: Please stay safe, Your Mailkeeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
